%% Sequence diagram: challenge → login → whoami → logout
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Ledger
    Client->>API: /auth/challenge
    API->>Ledger: log ChallengeRequested
    API-->>Client: challenge
    Client->>API: /auth/login (envelope, challenge)
    API->>Ledger: log AuthorizationRequestReceived
    API->>Ledger: log NonceConsumed
    API->>Ledger: log CapabilityIssued
    API-->>Client: session capability
    Client->>API: /whoami (capability)
    API->>Ledger: log CapabilityChecked
    API-->>Client: actor_id, key_id, TTL
    Client->>API: /auth/logout (capability)
    API->>Ledger: log CapabilityRevoked
    API-->>Client: logout confirmation
